{"id":"93b3305f115fb8fd","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-internal-equality.md","title":"内等式","display":"df-internal-equality — 内等式","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"1","label":"16-df-internal-equality","aliases":["16-df-internal-equality","Internal equality of arrows"],"display":"df-internal-equality — 内等式","depends_on":["[[16-df-eq-functor]]","[[16-df-eq-fibration]]"],"source":"Notation 3.4.2, pp. 191–192 (PDF 211–212); Lemma 3.4.5","revision_date":"2026-10-20"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-internal-equality"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-internal-equality</span><span>Internal equality of arrows</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-internal-equality — 内等式"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d70ce677a3070a45\" href=\"?note=d70ce677a3070a45\" title=\"16-df-eq-functor\">16-df-eq-functor</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"478c99d853e13c93\" href=\"?note=478c99d853e13c93\" title=\"16-df-eq-fibration\">16-df-eq-fibration</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Notation 3.4.2, pp. 191–192 (PDF 211–212); Lemma 3.4.5"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-20"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\">\\(p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\\)</span> 是 Eq-fibration；固定提升选择、基底有限积、纤维终对象以及满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d70ce677a3070a45\" href=\"?note=d70ce677a3070a45\" title=\"16-df-eq-functor\">16-df-eq-functor</a> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EqFrob}\">\\(\\mathrm{EqFrob}\\)</span> 的同一等式伴随数据族 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathsf{Eq}_{I,J},\\Phi_{I,J})_{I,J}\">\\((\\mathsf{Eq}_{I,J},\\Phi_{I,J})_{I,J}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u,v\\in\\mathcal B(I,J)\">\\(u,v\\in\\mathcal B(I,J)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta_{I,J}\">\\(\\delta_{I,J}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Eq}_{I,J}\">\\(\\mathsf{Eq}_{I,J}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d70ce677a3070a45\" href=\"?note=d70ce677a3070a45\" title=\"16-df-eq-functor\">16-df-eq-functor</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top_{I\\times J}\">\\(\\top_{I\\times J}\\)</span> 为所选纤维终对象；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\leq_IY\">\\(X\\leq_IY\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E_I}(X,Y)\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E_I}(X,Y)\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}internal\\text{-}equality}\\vdash\\quad \\operatorname{Eq}_p(u,v)\\coloneqq\n\\langle\\langle\\operatorname{id}_I,u\\rangle,v\\rangle^*\n\\mathsf{Eq}_{I,J}(\\top_{I\\times J})\\in\\mathcal E_I.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}internal\\text{-}equality}\\vdash\\quad \\operatorname{Eq}_p(u,v)\\coloneqq\n\\langle\\langle\\operatorname{id}_I,u\\rangle,v\\rangle^*\n\\mathsf{Eq}_{I,J}(\\top_{I\\times J})\\in\\mathcal E_I.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"u\\equiv_pv\\Longleftrightarrow\\top_I\\leq_I\\operatorname{Eq}_p(u,v).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[u\\equiv_pv\\Longleftrightarrow\\top_I\\leq_I\\operatorname{Eq}_p(u,v).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>参数换基给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w^*\\operatorname{Eq}_p(u,v)\\cong\\operatorname{Eq}_p(uw,vw)\">\\(w^*\\operatorname{Eq}_p(u,v)\\cong\\operatorname{Eq}_p(uw,vw)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>有终对象时可经规范同构写成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle u,v\\rangle^*\\mathsf{Eq}_{1,J}(\\top_J)\">\\(\\langle u,v\\rangle^*\\mathsf{Eq}_{1,J}(\\top_J)\\)</span>。外部相等 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u=v\">\\(u=v\\)</span> 蕴含内部相等，逆向需要额外强度。</li>\n<li>来源：Jacobs, <em>Categorical Logic and Type Theory</em>，Notation 3.4.2, pp. 191–192 (PDF 211–212); Lemma 3.4.5。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-eq-functor","status":"resolved","id":"d70ce677a3070a45","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-eq-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-eq-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"478c99d853e13c93","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-eq-fibration]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-eq-functor","status":"resolved","id":"d70ce677a3070a45","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 是 Eq-fibration；固定提升选择、基底有限积、纤维终对象以及满足 [[16-df-eq-functor]] 中 $\\mathrm{EqFrob}$ 的同一等式伴随数据族 $(\\mathsf{Eq}_{I,J},\\Phi_{I,J})_{I,J}$。$u,v\\in\\mathcal B(I,J)$。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-eq-functor","status":"resolved","id":"d70ce677a3070a45","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\delta_{I,J}$、$\\mathsf{Eq}_{I,J}$ 见 [[16-df-eq-functor]]，$\\top_{I\\times J}$ 为所选纤维终对象；$X\\leq_IY$ 表示 $\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E_I}(X,Y)\\ne\\varnothing$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EqFrob}","display":false},{"tex":"(\\mathsf{Eq}_{I,J},\\Phi_{I,J})_{I,J}","display":false},{"tex":"u,v\\in\\mathcal B(I,J)","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta_{I,J}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Eq}_{I,J}","display":false},{"tex":"\\top_{I\\times J}","display":false},{"tex":"X\\leq_IY","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E_I}(X,Y)\\ne\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}internal\\text{-}equality}\\vdash\\quad \\operatorname{Eq}_p(u,v)\\coloneqq\n\\langle\\langle\\operatorname{id}_I,u\\rangle,v\\rangle^*\n\\mathsf{Eq}_{I,J}(\\top_{I\\times J})\\in\\mathcal E_I.","display":true},{"tex":"u\\equiv_pv\\Longleftrightarrow\\top_I\\leq_I\\operatorname{Eq}_p(u,v).","display":true},{"tex":"w^*\\operatorname{Eq}_p(u,v)\\cong\\operatorname{Eq}_p(uw,vw)","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle u,v\\rangle^*\\mathsf{Eq}_{1,J}(\\top_J)","display":false},{"tex":"u=v","display":false}],"bytes":1572,"backlinks":[{"id":"22039ebbb905273f","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$⟦ s⟧_M:M\\Gamma\\to M(\\sigma)$ 为上述模型中的项箭头；$\\operatorname{Eq}_p(u,v)$ 的完整定义采用 [[16-df-internal-equality]]。$\\le_I$ 表示同一纤维内存在箭头。$\\bigwedge$ 为所选有限纤维积，空积为 $\\top_I$。"},{"id":"e29c92ba515d8b86","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 为 [[16-df-eq-fibration]] 的 Eq-fibration，$e_I=\\operatorname{Eq}_p(\\pi_1,\\pi_2)\\in\\mathcal E_{I\\times I}$ 采用 [[16-df-internal-equality]]。$R\\in\\mathcal E_{I\\times I}$ 是任意二元谓词，未预设为等价关系。"},{"id":"cca2b066cf07f3e7","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$R\\in\\mathcal E_{I\\times J}$，$\\wedge$ 为纤维积；$\\operatorname{Eq}_p$ 采用 [[16-df-internal-equality]]，$\\mathrm{Iso}_{\\mathcal B}$ 采用 [[16-df-pullback-square]]。$\\mathsf{SingleValued}$、$\\mathsf{ExistsValue}$、$\\mathsf{UniqueChoice}$ 为下文谓词。"},{"id":"f2143c499aae70cc","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 是 Eq-fibration，$\\equiv_p$ 见 [[16-df-internal-equality]]。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-266","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-df-internal-equality|df-internal-equality — 内等式]]"},{"id":"d2e1d180cc0ebd2e","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"假设 $\\mathsf{SubsetComp}(p,\\chi)$，采用 [[16-df-subset-type]]。$\\mathrm{VStrongEq}$ 是 [[16-df-very-strong-equality]] 中待刻画的谓词，未预先假设成立；$\\operatorname{Eq}_p$ 采用 [[16-df-internal-equality]]。$e_I,\\delta_I$ 及 $\\kappa_I$ 如下定义，$\\pi_1,\\pi_2$ 为 $I\\times I$ 的所选投影。"},{"id":"da549ca22fc9a7df","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"内部等式 $\\operatorname{Eq}_p(u,v)$、$\\equiv_p$ 采用 [[16-df-internal-equality]]；$\\mathrm{VStrongEq}(p)$ 采用 [[16-df-very-strong-equality]]。"}],"outgoing":["d70ce677a3070a45","478c99d853e13c93"]}